### Create Bill  POST/bills
POST {{Base_URL}}/bills/
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="billName"

Test Restaurant
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receiptFile"; filename="Receipt.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:\Pasit\CCW1\WongLao\Backend\uploads\receipts\Receipt.png
--boundary--



